  - [ ] Link to /blog/[slug].

- [ ] Post page /app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx:
  - [ ] generateStaticParams() → posts.map(p => ({ slug: p.slug }))
  - [ ] Find post by slug from the registry and render the MDX component inside a Prose wrapper.
- [ ] SEO: use generateMetadata to read meta and set title/description/og.

